---
import Section from "../ui/Section.astro";
import Terminal from "../ui/Terminal.astro";

const dim = "text-muted-foreground";
---

<Section id="terminal" title="Lives in your terminal" hash="c40e6b8">
  <p class="mb-5 max-w-[60ch] text-text-secondary">
    Scriptable commands when you know what you want. Run <code class="text-foreground">devver</code> alone to
    browse your deployments in the terminal UI.
  </p>
  <Terminal title="devver">
devver
├── deploy        <span class={dim}>deploy the committed revision</span>
├── init          <span class={dim}>create the project's config</span>
├── new server    <span class={dim}>create and attach a local server</span>
├── cloud         <span class={dim}>switch to Devver cloud</span>
├── auth login    <span class={dim}>sign in from the browser</span>
├── project list  <span class={dim}>select your project</span>
└── secret        <span class={dim}>manage environment secrets</span>
  </Terminal>
  <p class="mt-3 text-muted-foreground">j/k/h/l move · o open · c copy · r rename · q quit</p>
</Section>
